{
  "uid": "formula-overview",
  "title": "墨析 运行总览",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "读图口径",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "[自动错误中心](/d/formula-errors) · 指标每15秒采集；速率/分位数需至少两次采集。无样本显示“暂无样本”，不表示成功率100%。账号HTTP不含SSE、登录认证与遥测入口。任务结果是进程观察值，重启归零，不能用于计费；取消不计入成功率分母。排队包含延迟重试，队列快照失效时隐藏积压值。AI按real/mock分开。\n\n[查看业务日志](/d/formula-runtime) · [日志与Trace查询](/explore)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "API 可采集",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "formula-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"formula-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{kind}} {{mode}} {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "暂无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
